    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A neural interface booster and omni-tool amplification module that increases the output power of both tech and biotic abilities. For tech users, it improves omni-tool field generation efficiency; for biotics, it enhances the dark energy focusing resonators built into the suit. Grants a +1 item bonus to ability/spell damage rolls (tech and biotic powers).</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto armor in your inventory to install it. Its bonus applies while the armor it is installed in is worn. The +1 is added to the damage your biotic and tech powers deal.</em></p>"
